            "url": "https://www.building.co.uk/buildings/a-wing-and-a-prayer-what-future-for-airport-terminals/5106158.article",
            "title": "QSB3aW5nIGFuZCBhIHByYXllcjogd2hhdCBmdXR1cmUgZm9yIGFpcnBvcnQgdGVybWluYWxzPw==",
