/ArbanWP/history/)\n    *   [Our Process](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/our-process/)\n    *   [Experience](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/experience/)\n*   [Awards](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/awards/)\n*   [Projects](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/category/projects/)\n    *   [Commercial](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/category/projects/commercial/)\n    *   [Educational](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/category/projects/educational/)\n    *   [Government](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/category/projects/government/)\n    *   [Hospitality](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/category/projects/hospitality/)\n    *   [Medical](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/category/projects/medical/)\n    *   [Mix Use](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/category/projects/mix-use/)\n    *   [Parking Garages](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/category/projects/parking-garages/)\n    *   [Residential](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/category/projects/residential/)\n*   [Resources](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/precast-finishes/)\n    *   [Precast Finishes](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/precast-finishes/)\n    *   [Sustainability](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/sustainability/)\n    *   [Education](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/education/)\n    *   [Technical Information](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/technical-information/)\n*   [Contact](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/directions/)\n    *   [Contact Us](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/directions/)\n    *   [Employment](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/employment/)\n    *   [A&C Web Mail Access](https://login.microsoftonline.com/)\n    *   [Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/arbancarosi)\n\nScroll to Content\n\nDulles People Mover – Dulles, Virginia\n======================================\n\n[![Image 4](https://i0.wp.com/arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/dulles-people-mover-1_xl.jpg?resize=400%2C285&ssl=1)](https://i0.wp.com/arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/dulles-people-mover-1_xl.jpg?ssl=1)\n\n[![Image 5](https://i0.wp.com/arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/dulles-people-mover-2_xl.jpg?resize=400%2C285&ssl=1)](https://i0.wp.com/arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/dulles-people-mover-2_xl.jpg?ssl=1)\n\n[![Image 6](https://i0.wp.com/arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/dulles-people-mover-3_xl.jpg?resize=400%2C285&ssl=1)](https://i0.wp.com/arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/dulles-people-mover-3_xl.jpg?ssl=1)\n\n[![Image 7](https://i0.wp.com/arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/dulles-people-mover-4_xl.jpg?resize=400%2C285&ssl=1)](https://i0.wp.com/arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/dulles-people-mover-4_xl.jpg?ssl=1)\n\n[![Image 8](https://i0.wp.com/arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/dulles-people-mover-5_xl.jpg?resize=400%2C285&ssl=1)](https://i0.wp.com/arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/dulles-people-mover-5_xl.jpg?ssl=1)\n\n[![Image 9](https://i0.wp.com/arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/dulles-people-mover-6_xl.jpg?resize=400%2C285&ssl=1)](https://i0.wp.com/arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/dulles-people-mover-6_xl.jpg?ssl=1)\n\n[![Image 10](https://i0.wp.com/arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/dulles-people-mover-7_xl.jpg?resize=400%2C285&ssl=1)](https://i0.wp.com/arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/dulles-people-mover-7_xl.jpg?ssl=1)\n\n[![Image 11](https://i0.wp.com/arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/dulles-people-mover-8_xl.jpg?resize=400%2C285&ssl=1)](https://i0.wp.com/arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/dulles-people-mover-8_xl.jpg?ssl=1)\n\n[![Image 12](https://i0.wp.com/arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/dulles-people-mover-9_xl.jpg?resize=400%2C285&ssl=1)](https://i0.wp.com/arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/dulles-people-mover-9_xl.jpg?ssl=1)\n\n[![Image 13](https://i0.wp.com/arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/dulles-people-mover_xl.jpg?resize=400%2C285&ssl=1)](https://i0.wp.com/arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/dulles-people-mover_xl.jpg?ssl=1)\n\n[![Image 14](https://i0.wp.com/arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/dulles_rend2_xl.jpg?resize=350%2C262&ssl=1)](https://i0.wp.com/arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/dulles_rend2_xl.jpg?ssl=1)\n\n**Architect:** [SOM](http://www.som.com/)\n\n**Owner:** Washington Metropolitan Airport Authority\n\n**General Contractor:** [Turner Construction Co.](http://www.turnerconstruction.com/)\n\n**Precast Erector:** E.E. Marr Erectors\n\nThis was one of the most unique projects in our long history. The project entailed the construction of the underground main station for the new aerotrain at Dulles International Airport.\n\nUniquely, the precast clad the interior of the underground station. The walls of the station were clad by yellow/tan acid-etch panels with a faceted 8’x4’ pattern. The train tunnels tubes were clad by sloped precast panels with a terrazzo finish (applied in our yard) on the face.\n\nThe erection of these panels was extremely difficult. The panels had to be dropped onto a cart, from a hole through a skylight. They were then carted into position where they were erected by chain-falls, both manually and mechanically. This procedure was repeated over 600 times for each panel.\n\nEvery time we fly out of Dulles Airport – we are reminded of this quality work and craftsmanship.\n\n### Projects\n\n*   [Commercial](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/category/projects/commercial/)\n*   [Educational](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/category/projects/educational/)\n*   [Government](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/category/projects/government/)\n*   [Hospitality](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/category/projects/hospitality/)\n*   [Medical](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/category/projects/medical/)\n*   [Mix Use](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/category/projects/mix-use/)\n*   [Parking Garages](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/category/projects/parking-garages/)\n*   [Residential](https://arbancarosi.com/ArbanWP/category/projects/residential/)\n\n### Social Icons\n\n*   [facebook](https://www.facebook.com/arbancarosi \"Friend me on Facebook\")\n*   [youtube](https://www.youtube.com/user/ArbanCarosi)\n\nCopyright © 2023 Arban, Carosi & Diana Precast, LLC",
